    "sub_name": "智慧城市永續發展專題論壇",
    "sub_ename": "SPECIAL FORUM ON SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT OF SMART CITIES",
    "describe_ch": "本課程透過邀請國內外產、官、學界智慧城市永續發展之專家進行專題演講及座談，訓練同學思考如何應用智慧科技解決城市問題，規劃未來城市發展可能面向。",
    "describe_eh": "Through inviting experts from industry, government, and academia to give lectures and seminars on the sustainable development of smart cities, students will be trained to think about how to apply smart technology to solve urban problems and plan possible directions for future urban development.",
